# Kimss Python SDK — AI assistants

Follow [AI_INTEGRATION.md](AI_INTEGRATION.md) for every integration.

1. Never use `KimssClient` for chat/completions.
2. Always use the official OpenAI SDK with `base_url=https://api.kimss.ai/v1`.
3. Always inject `X-Kimss-Agent-Id` (and `X-Kimss-Agent-Name`) via `extra_headers` or default headers.
4. Vault Anthropic/Azure in Kimss; do not point Anthropic Messages clients at `api.kimss.ai`.
5. Hermis / interceptors: forward Agent-Id headers; never strip them.
6. Kill switch: `agent_disabled`. Keys: `kimss_...`. Positioning: Secure AI Gateway & Governance Control Plane — never “zero-trust”.

Dense map: [docs/llm-context.md](docs/llm-context.md). Humans: [GETTING_STARTED.md](GETTING_STARTED.md).
